🚀 Smart Roadmap for Student Placements – From Confusion to Career Clarity!

I'm happy to share our capstone project, Smart Roadmap for Student Placements 🎓

Our project focuses on helping students prepare for campus placements in a structured and personalized way. It provides guidance to students on identifying their skills, improving their knowledge, and following a clear roadmap towards their career goals.

Through this project, we aim to make placement preparation easier, more organized, and accessible for students.

🔍 Key Highlights:
• Personalized learning recommendations
• Skill assessment
• Structured placement preparation roadmap
• Career guidance
• Learning progress tracking
• Project recommendations
• Interview and aptitude preparation

